From 21419738cf7633b5bb657f4f6700de98e9c8fb0d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ChenXiaoSong <chenxiaosong@kylinos.cn>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:49:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 25/39] smb: move EA definitions to common header files

The client and server define the same full EA information and CREATE
EA context layouts. Move the definitions to common/fscc.h and
common/smb2pdu.h.

Rename the following places:

  - smb2_ea_info -> smb2_file_full_ea_info
  - create_ea_buf_req -> smb2_create_ea_ctx

Prepared with assistance from OpenAI Codex.
---
 fs/smb/client/smb2pdu.h | 14 -------
 fs/smb/common/fscc.h    |  9 +++++
 fs/smb/common/smb2pdu.h |  9 +++++
 fs/smb/server/smb2pdu.c | 88 ++++++++++++++++++++---------------------
 fs/smb/server/smb2pdu.h | 15 -------
 5 files changed, 62 insertions(+), 73 deletions(-)

diff --git a/fs/smb/client/smb2pdu.h b/fs/smb/client/smb2pdu.h
